Recommendations

The `Shop` sends clicks to the `Event stream`. The `Trainer` reads the
`Event stream` and writes a model to the `Model store`. The `Recommender` loads
the model from the `Model store`, and the `Shop` asks the `Recommender`.
---
Shop -> Event stream: clicks
Trainer -> Event stream: read
Trainer -> Model store: write model
Recommender -> Model store: load
Shop -> Recommender: ask
